TENDL-2017 (TALYS Evaluated Nuclear Data Library)                 8234 1451   11
                                                                  8234 1451   12
Pb207 proton general purpose library                              8234 1451   13
                                                                  8234 1451   14
Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                         8234 1451   15
                                                                  8234 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning and D. Rochman,                                 8234 1451   17
      Modern nuclear data evaluation with the TALYS code system,  8234 1451   18
